{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在無綫節目《阿爺廚房》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）曾示範炮製清新健康的「素鬆生菜包」。這道菜將甘筍、木耳、馬蹄及豆腐乾等豐富食材切粒猛火爆炒，完美保留蔬菜的原汁原味。熱辣辣的素鬆配上鮮嫩的西生菜，一口咬下馬蹄與榨菜的清爽脆度瞬間爆發，口感層次極為豐富，清甜惹味而不油膩，絕對是健康又開胃的必學佳餚！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"277fa4ab-7019-49a0-b296-75fb127db953.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026YoD5gHHjzH1784689728.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"277fa4ab-7019-49a0-b296-75fb127db953.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9d666704-545d-4fe6-9ef4-4b7477d412ef.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20263nQX0hXxvP1784689734.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9d666704-545d-4fe6-9ef4-4b7477d412ef.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>食材準備</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西生菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">豆腐乾</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">木耳</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">馬蹄</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">榨菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西芹</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">唐芹</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">甘筍</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">糖</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>烹調步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T09:19:19.027141+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}